  "translation": "This afternoon, I went to the park with a friend. We set out from home and after half an hour we arrived. There were many flowers in the park, and in front of the lake there was a bench. First we walked by the lake, then later we went east to the woods. It was very quiet there; we were reading a book under a tree, and I could see the lake. My friend brought three pieces of cake; I didn't eat too much, only one piece. The cake was very delicious; I also ate one piece and drank two glasses of juice. At this moment, I saw a bird happily singing in a tree. My friend asked me whether to go east or west; I said east. I asked him what food he had brought, and he smiled. We walked along the path to the south gate, then went home. I often come here with my friend. Today is really the happiest day!"
